duces products to audiences in a relatable way while learning more about digital marketing, trends, and online engagement.</p>\n<span>Content Creation</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"role-card\" href=\"web-development.html\">\n<div class=\"role-icon\">&lt;/&gt;</div>\n<h2>Web Development</h2>\n<p>I design and build responsive web interfaces with a strong focus on clean layouts, usability, visual hierarchy, and attractive user interface design.</p>\n<span>UI / Front-End</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"role-card\" href=\"graphic-design.html\">\n<div class=\"role-icon\">✎</div>\n<h2>Graphic Designer</h2>\n<p>I create layouts, social media graphics, promotional visuals, and branding materials that balance aesthetics, clarity, and the identity of a project or business.</p>\n<span>Visual Design</span>\n</a>\n</section>\n<section class=\"growth-banner\">\n<div class=\"growth-icon\">&lt;/&gt;</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Building at the intersection of creativity and technology.</h2>\n<p>My goal is to keep improving my web development, interface design, graphic design, content creation, and practical Computer Science skills through real projects and continuous learning.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"growth-actions\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"contact.html\">Let's Connect</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"achievements.html\">See My Background</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"showcase neon-panel\" id=\"web-projects\">\n<div class=\"showcase-head\">\n<div><h2>Selected Web Projects</h2><p>Some websites I created while developing my front-end and interface design skills.</p></div>\n<a class=\"small-link\" href=\"#top\">Close ×</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-row project-preview-row\">\n<article class=\"project-card live-project-card\">\n<div class=\"project-browser-preview\">\n<div class=\"browser-preview-bar\">\n<div class=\"browser-dots\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"browser-address\">shanerafol.github.io/Shane/</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-frame-wrap\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/RegEx-Game/start-game.html\" title=\"Live preview of RegEx Game\"></iframe>\n<div class=\"preview-badge\">Live Preview</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-preview-content\">\n<h3>RegEx Game</h3>\n<p>\n              An organized, informative, responsive, and user-friendly\n              RegEx game project.\n            </p>\n<a href=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/RegEx-Game/start-game.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n              Open Full Website ↗\n            </a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"project-card live-project-card\">\n<div class=\"project-browser-preview\">\n<div class=\"browser-preview-bar\">\n<div class=\"browser-dots\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"browser-address\">shanerafol.github.io/Valentine-Proposal/</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-frame-wrap\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/Valentine-Proposal/\" title=\"Live preview of Valentine Proposal Website\"></iframe>\n<div class=\"preview-badge\">Live Preview</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-preview-content\">\n<h3>Valentine Proposal</h3>\n<p>\n              A playful and interactive Valentine proposal website\n              with a responsive experience.\n            </p>\n<a href=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/Valentine-Proposal/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n              Open Full Website ↗\n            </a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"project-card live-project-card\">\n<div class=\"project-browser-preview\">\n<div class=\"browser-preview-bar\">\n<div class=\"browser-dots\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"browser-address\">shanerafol.github.io/mothersdaygift/</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-frame-wrap\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/mothersdaygift/\" title=\"Live preview of Mother's Day Website\"></iframe>\n<div class=\"preview-badge\">Live Preview</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-preview-content\">\n<h3>Mother's Day Website</h3>\n<p>\n              A heartfelt digital gift website with a warm,\n              creative, and personal design.\n            </p>\n<a href=\"https://shanerafol.github.io/mothersdaygift/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n              Open Full Website ↗\n            </a>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"showcase neon-panel\" id=\"graphic-designs\">\n<div class=\"showcase-head\">\n<div><h2>Graphic Design Gallery</h2><p>My graphic design categories and linked Canva projects.</p></div>\n<a class=\"small-link\" href=\"#top\">Close ×</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"graphic-row\">\n<article class=\"graphic-card\"><img alt=\"Logo Design placeholder\" src=\"images/graphics/graphic-1.jpg\"/><h3>Logo Design</h3><a href=\"https://canva.link/enonmo4ja9nnsed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">View Project ↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"graphic-card\"><img alt=\"Professional ID Photos placeholder\" src=\"images/graphics/graphic-2.jpg\"/><h3>Professional ID Photos</h3><a href=\"https://canva.link/yesnsdu9fybnpfj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">View Project ↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"graphic-card\"><img alt=\"Officers Poster Design placeholder\" src=\"images/graphics/graphic-3.jpg\"/><h3>Officers Poster Design</h3><a href=\"https://canva.link/pxrqfck1w7e2wna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">View Project ↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"graphic-card\"><img alt=\"Cover Page Design placeholder\" src=\"images/graphics/graphic-4.jpg\"/><h3>Cover Page Design</h3><a href=\"https://canva.link/030542ajdp2x0ua\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">View Project ↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"graphic-card\"><img alt=\"Profes