ll><strong>github.com/Shanerafol</strong><span>Open Link ↗</span></div>\n</a>\n</section>\n<section class=\"hello-panel\">\n<div class=\"mail-art\">✉</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Say hello ✦</h2>\n<p>Whether it is about a creative idea, a school project, a web design concept, business collaboration, or simply connecting online, feel free to reach out.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hello-actions\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:rafolshane1@gmail.com\">Send an Email</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://github.com/Shanerafol\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit GitHub</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"container\">© 2026 Shane Lowelle R. Rafol · Contact</div>\n</footer>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n", "bodyClass": "", "title": "Contact | Shane Rafol"}, "achievements": {"body": "\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n<div class=\"container navbar\">\n<a aria-label=\"Shane home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\">Shane</a>\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span></span>\n<span></span>\n<span></span>\n</button>\n<nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"nav-links\">\n<a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">About</a>\n<div class=\"nav-dropdown\">\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-btn\" id=\"dropdownBtn\" type=\"button\">\n          Work <span aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"dropdownArrow\">▼</span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"dropdownMenu\">\n<a href=\"business-owner.html\">Business Owner</a>\n<a href=\"tiktok-affiliate.html\">TikTok Affiliate</a>\n<a href=\"web-development.html\">Web Development</a>\n<a href=\"graphic-design.html\">Graphic Design</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"active\" href=\"achievements.html\">Achievements</a>\n<a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"container page-main\">\n<section class=\"page-heading\">\n<h1>My <span>Achievements</span></h1>\n<p>\n        These certificates represent programs, seminars, leadership activities,\n        and events I have participated in, as well as the recognition I received\n        from those experiences.\n      </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"achievements-grid\">\n<article class=\"certificate-card\">\n<div class=\"certificate-image-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"Digital Exhibit 2026 Certificate of Appreciation\" class=\"certificate-image\" src=\"images/certificates/certificate-1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certificate-info\">\n<span class=\"certificate-number\">01</span>\n<h2>Digital Exhibit 2026</h2>\n<p>\n            Awarded by the Tangub City Global College Institute of Computer Studies\n            in recognition of my participation as a Presenter during Digital Exhibit 2026\n            with the theme “Where Ideas Go Digital, Culture and Innovation Connect.”\n            The event was held on May 6, 2026, at the TCGCC Covered Court in Tangub City.\n          </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"certificate-card\">\n<div class=\"certificate-image-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"EMPOWERED Student Leaders' Camp Certificate of Participation\" class=\"certificate-image\" src=\"images/certificates/certificate-2.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certificate-info\">\n<span class=\"certificate-number\">02</span>\n<h2>EMPOWERED: Student Leaders' Camp</h2>\n<p>\n            Awarded by Tangub City Global College for my participation in the\n            EMPOWERED: Student Leaders' Camp as Secretary of the Junior Programming\n            Enthusiasts Group of Computer Students. The camp was conducted on\n            June 20–21, 2026, with the theme “Leading With Passion, Integrity In Action.”\n          </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"certificate-card\">\n<div class=\"certificate-image-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"Lux Mundis Cup 2025 Certificate of Appreciation\" class=\"certificate-image\" src=\"images/certificates/certificate-3.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certificate-info\">\n<span class=\"certificate-number\">03</span>\n<h2>Lux Mundis Cup 2025</h2>\n<p>\n            Awarded by the Tangub City Global College Supreme Student Council in\n            recognition of my dedication, professionalism, and commitment to\n            addressing grievances with fairness, empathy, and integrity during the\n            Lux Mundis Cup 2025. The event was held on November 11–15, 2025, with\n            the theme “Pixiehollow, Festival of Talents.”\n          </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"certificate-card\">\n<div class=\"certificate-image-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"IT Seminar Certificate of Participation\" class=\"certificate-image\" src=\"images/certificates/certificate-4.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certificate-info\">\n<span class=\"certificate-number\">04</span>\n<h2>IT Seminar: Ecommerce MVP + GSSO + Analytics with Django &amp; Nuxt</h2>\n<p>\n            Awarded in recognition of my active participation in the IT Seminar with\n            the topic “Ecommerce MVP + GSSO + Analytics with Django &amp; Nuxt.”\n            The seminar was held on August 24, 2026, from 3:00 PM to 5:00 PM\n            at Tangub City Global College, Tangub City, Misamis Occidental.\n          </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"certificate-card\">\n<div class=\"certificate-image-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"Cybersecurity For All Code Camp Season 4 Certificate of Participation\" class=\"certificate-image\" src=\"images/certificates/certificate-5.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certificate-info\">\n<span class=\"certificate-number\">05</span>\n<h2>Cybersecurity For All Code Camp Season 4</h2>\n<p>\n            Awarded by La Salle University for my successful participation in the\n            Cybersecurity For All Code Camp Season 4 with the theme\n            “Think Smart, Code Smarter, Powering Businesses Through Technology.”\n            The event was held on August 29, 2026, at the La Salle University\n            Arts Center in Ozamiz City, Philippines.\n          </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"container\">© 2026 Shane Lowelle R. Rafol · Achievements</div>\n</footer>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n", "bodyClass": "", "title": "Achievements | Shane Rafol"}, "index": {"body": "\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n<div class=\"container navbar\">\n<a aria-label=\"Shane home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\">Shane</a>\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</button>\n<nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"nav-links\">\n<a class=\"active\" href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">About</a>\n<div class=\"nav-dropdown\">\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-btn\" id=\"dropdownBtn\" type=\"button\">\n          Work <span aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"dropdownArrow\">▼</span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"dropdownMenu\">\n<a href=\"business-owner.html\">Business Owner</a>\n<a href=\"tiktok-affiliate.html\">TikTok Affiliate</a>\n<a href=\"web-development.html\">Web Development</a>\n<a href=\"graphic-design.html\">Graphic Design</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a href=\"achievements.html\">Achievements</a>\n<a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section class=\"container hero\">\n<div class=\"hero-copy\">\n<p class=\"hero-kicker\">Creative student • designer • developer</p>\n<h1>SHANE<br/>LOWELLE <span>R.</span><br/><span>RAFOL</span></h1>\n<p class=\"hero-intro\">\n          I am a Computer Science student who loves combining creativity and technology.\n          I enjoy building visually appealing digital experiences, designing graphics,\n          exploring web development, and turning ideas into purposeful projects.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"work.html\">View My Work ✦</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"contact.html\">Contact Me</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"code-strip\">\n<span>const</span> shane = { <b>role</b>: \"CS Student\", <b>passion</b>: \"Design + Tech\" };\n        </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-portrait\">\n<div class=\"neon-orbit orbit-one\"></div>\n<div class=\"neon-orbit orbit-two\"></div>\n<div class=\"portrait-shell\">\n<img alt=\"Portrait used in Shane's portfolio reference\" src=\"images/profile.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<span class=\"float-tag tag-ui\">✦ UI Design</span>\n<span class=\"float-tag tag-dev\">&lt;/&gt; Web Dev</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"container\">© 2026 Shane Lowelle R. Rafol · Designed with creativity + code.</div>\n</footer>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n", "bodyClass": "home-page", "title": "Shane Rafol | Portfolio"}}